    <string name="delete_account_consequence">When it happens, your name and email are erased and you can no longer sign in. Everything you wrote becomes a blank space in your shared archive, so the other person's days and streak stay as they were. Your photos, voice notes, bookmarks and reactions are deleted, and any bond you are in ends as if you had left it. After that it cannot be undone.</string>
